# DLB triggers — Devops Leading Brief

When the user message matches a trigger below, follow **`/DLB`** — **Skill (Dual Resolve — load once):** resolve paths only first — `sicon-devops-leading-brief` → `skills/devops-leading-brief/SKILL.md` (plugin direct → newest `plugins/marketplaces|cache` bounded → user-pack skills dogfood only if no plugin; never prefer pack) — then Read exactly the one resolved file in full. Do **not** Read any other copy of this skill this invoke (if a copy was already loaded this turn, reuse it — this resolve applies from the next invoke).

## Engage when any

- `/DLB <id>` or `/dlb <id>` → **brief** mode
- `/DLB <id> implement` / `/DLB <id> and implement` / close variants → **implement** (inline unless user pins Superpowers)
- `/DLB <id> fullmonty` / `full monty` / `full-monty` / `the full monty` (and close variants) → **implement + ship autoland** (no Enrich stop; no ship offer; no message gate; `/pr-clearance` to quiet when tooling present, else warn + skip)
- Bare `fullmonty` (or close variants) in a thread that already ran DLB → same as implement go-ahead **plus** ship autoland
- `/DLB` or `/dlb` (bare — then ask for the card number)
- `load devops card <cardnumber> for context` → **brief** unless they also say implement / fullmonty / just do it / don't ask me
- `I want to look at devops card <cardnumber> please fetch it for context` → **brief**
- Close variants that clearly ask to **load / fetch / pull / brief** an ADO/DevOps **card** **for context** → **brief**
- “devops leading brief” / “DLB” with a card number **and** explicit **load / fetch / pull / brief-for-context** intent → **brief** unless implement / fullmonty phrases present

Also engage **Orient Q&A** when, in a thread that already ran DLB, the user asks where to start or how to probe the loaded card — answer from context; do not change mode.

**Brief:** Enrich in the report; **purge stale `{id}` brief files then write** thin brief; stop (unless **fullmonty**). Enrich is not a gate option.  
**Implement:** **inline** unless the user pins Superpowers; **seed only from this-invoke thin brief** (never a prior-run file); require clean write-root tree; **typesetter Dual Resolve required** before first edit (fail closed if missing); tip-close after code (silent format→lint scripts + hard static floor) then Prove; then **offer** ship (message gate before any commit/PR) — do not auto-ship. Hard fence: do not auto-load Superpowers / SDD / TDD.  
**fullmonty:** implement + ship **autoland** (draft + land as if **`go`**); stop only on obvious blockers (incl. typesetter miss / tip-close red); product decisions **early** (before first edit when visible); **disregard** security broaden; when clearance tooling resolves → **drive `/pr-clearance` to quiet** before ship-complete, else warn + skip (plugin surface cannot require clearance). **Tip close + Prove:** silent typesetter prep + static floor then Prove; new tests only when Fix-in is **270**; non-270 → build + existing tests; cherry follow-ups omit tests/project files unless Join. Not a rename of `/nineyards`.

## When NOT to engage

- Casual mention of a work item without asking to load/fetch context
- `/dev-triage`, `/devops-card` (different tools)
- Halo-only browsing with no ADO card id
- Bare `/nineyards` without a DLB card context (different command — do not remap to fullmonty)
